<title>USA: Chase Brass names Michael Segraves CFO.</title>
<headline>Chase Brass names Michael Segraves CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MONTPELIER, Ohio 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chase Brass Industries Inc said Wednesday Michael Segraves has joined the company to become chief financial officer, vice president and treasurer.  </p>
<p>It said Segraves would replace Frederick Deichert, who resigned to become a partner in a local public accounting firm.</p>
<p>Segraves was chief financial officer of AMP-Akzo Co before it was acquired by AMP Inc, it said.</p>
<p>Through its wholly owned subsidiaries Chase Brass &amp; Copper Co Inc and Leavitt Tube Co Inc, Chase Brass makes brass rods and structural and mechanical steel tubing.</p>
